# NOTE: the custom aether-proxy image (distroless/cc base + custom Envoy with the
# compiled-in C++ aether_stats extension) and all its build wiring moved to the
# separate //proxy workspace (proposals 010/012), which is listed in
# //.bazelignore. aether no longer builds the proxy image; the chart references
# the published image (see charts/aether/values.yaml). That move took the only
# C/C++ in the repo with it — aether now has no cgo / cc_* targets (zero C++
# build actions), so it carries no C/C++ toolchain: Go and protobuf resolve the
# auto-detected host cc toolchain for the rare analysis-time reference. The
# hermetic LLVM toolchain, glibc sysroots, and //bazel/llvm bindgen plumbing that
# served the old proxy cdylib were removed with it.
